    <description><![CDATA[An open-source reimplementation of the most famous civilization-building game ever - fast, small, no ads, free forever!

Build your civilization, research technologies, expand your cities and defeat your foes!
]]></description>
    <summary>Civ V remake for Android &amp; Desktop</summary>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[[Releases](https://github.com/yairm210/Unciv/releases)

## 5.0.0

Web version of Unciv! - By YosefLm

skip 'player ready' screen for hotseat when changing options

Automated Settlers can think a tile is good but it's actually unsettleable, if so, explore for a different tile

By mvanhorn:
- Keep marble wonder production bonuses local to the owning city 
- Prevent carrier healing moves from failing during payload placement 

Research agreement trade is only valid while the offerer can pay - By Qualia-Li

New CS bullying uniques for BNW's Gunboat Diplomacy - By HungLTL

Do not match 'in cities following our religion' when neither side has a religion - By ibrahim-iqbal]]></releaseNotes>
